<Bindings>
	<!-- The Show window key (launcher-§6): clicks the plain, hidden WhatGroupTogglePopup button that modules/Frame.lua creates at load, which runs WhatGroup:ToggleFrame, the handler the launcher menu's Show window entry runs. Its labels and NS.BINDINGS are set there. Every binding names this addon's own category, BINDING_HEADER_WHATGROUP, which the client titles with that global (the brand), and none carries a header attribute, which would draw as a blank spacer row inside the category. No default key: the player picks one under Options, Keybindings, Ka0s WhatGroup, or on the General page's Keybindings tab. The button name is permanent; renaming it unbinds every player's key. -->
	<Binding name="CLICK WhatGroupTogglePopup:LeftButton" category="BINDING_HEADER_WHATGROUP"/>
</Bindings>
